  <!-- Remote server: where the pages are drawn, and what that costs -->
  <data name="RemoteNotice" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The server draws the pages, so whoever runs it can read everything you read, passwords included. This build ships pointed at the project's own hosted server, with the server engine as its default, and that choice is kept: with no address and token below, or with the switch off, nothing is drawn at all rather than drawn on this phone. Pick another engine above to read pages on this phone, or replace the address with a server you run.</value>
